<h2>Customizing Your Homepage</h2>

<p>
    You can customize the homepage to match how you work. In your Profile settings, you can:
</p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Hide widgets</strong> – Turn off widgets you don't use</li>
    <li><strong>Collapse widgets</strong> – Set widgets to start collapsed so they take up less space</li>
    <li><strong>Adjust rows</strong> – Control how many items show in each widget</li>
    <li><strong>Change layout</strong> – Modify which widgets appear and in what order</li>
</ul>

<p>
    The goal is to make the homepage show you exactly what you need to see, in the way that's most useful for your workflow.
</p>

