<h2>Daily Inspiration</h2>

<p>
    The homepage also includes a Daily Inspiration widget that shows verses, quotes, or motivational content. You can:
</p>

<ul>
    <li>Choose what type of content to see (verses, quotes, etc.)</li>
    <li>Hide it completely if you prefer</li>
    <li>Change it anytime in your Profile settings</li>
</ul>

<p>
    This is completely optional—customize it to your preference or hide it if you want to focus purely on work items.
</p>

