<h2>Tips for Using the Homepage</h2>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Check it first thing</strong> – Start your day by reviewing what needs attention</li>
    <li><strong>Use Daily Tasks for quick notes</strong> – Add personal reminders as they come up</li>
    <li><strong>Clear work tiles regularly</strong> – Process items in the middle column to keep your pipeline moving</li>
    <li><strong>Review alerts periodically</strong> – Check the right column when you have a moment</li>
    <li><strong>Customize to your workflow</strong> – Adjust settings so the homepage shows what matters to you</li>
    <li><strong>Use "Show All" strategically</strong> – Focused view for daily work, expanded view for planning</li>
</ul>

<!-- IMAGE PLACEHOLDER: A simple infographic or checklist showing the tips above with icons or illustrations. Make it visually appealing and easy to reference. -->

<h2>How the Homepage Updates</h2>

<p>
    The homepage updates automatically as work happens:
</p>

<ul>
    <li>When you complete a task, it disappears from Renewal Flow Tasks</li>
    <li>When a new proposal is created, it appears in Proposal Pipeline</li>
    <li>When a certificate is requested, it shows up in Certificate Requests</li>
    <li>When a payment is recorded, it appears in Recent Payments</li>
</ul>

<p>
    You can also manually refresh the page if you want to see the latest updates. The homepage is designed to always show you current information.
</p>

